# Hollins Cannery (CIPlay hollins_cannery): The Lullaby Frequency's first island, quest "The Night Shift". The yard (3 m)
# round x -14..10; the hall x -12..-3 z -3..3 (door x -9..-7.5 on z -3); the cold store x 0..4.5 z -3..1.5 (its door
# panel x 1.5..3, the keypad on a post at -0.8 -3.6); the slipway down x -8 from z -11 to -34.
island Hollins Cannery
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The Night Shift
wait 3
expect shown hallhum
expect hidden colddark
walk -8 -30 to -8 -26 to -8 -18
zone slipway
expect step 1
expect message shift bell
walk -8 -12 to -8.25 -5 to -8.25 -1 h=3.2
read Shift log - night of the 14th
expect step 2
code coldkeypad 111 wrong
expect shown colddoor
code coldkeypad 312
expect hidden colddoor
expect shown colddark
expect step 3
walk 2.25 -5 to 2.25 -2 to 2.25 -0.5 h=3.2
zone coldstore
wait 2
kill Rat
expect step 4
open Foreman's desk
expect story cagekey 1
expect step 5
use pimcage
expect survivor lullaby_pim
open Pim's tin box
expect hidden hallhum
expect message She sings at 3:12
expect done
storespot 0 -6
